all you! How's life at <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         It's ok. I'm running out of material to blog about. After I get home tonight, I'll try and get creative.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "24000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     I'm sure it's hard to be creative on a daily basis. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Aren't you tired of inventing new dishes every week? How's work, by the way?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Work is good. I wish I didn't have to be managing people sometimes. They can be very difficult.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         That ought to be really stressful. You know, I could blog about your restaurant ... or about being a chef at a restaurant!", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "46000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Before I go in tomorrow, I'll send you a list of ideas to write about. You can bring them up with your boss.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         You don't have to do that ... I'm sure you're very busy!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     It's no problem at all. If you send me a text to remind me, I won't forget!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}